{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Who sends forth</b> — After he mentioned the sea, it is known that the vapor rises from the sea, and it is the cause of rain. And so it is written: He who calls to the waters of the sea, and the waters of the rain become the springs, and from them the streams."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 104, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:38:10.780093289Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}